 install.sh                                    |  39 +++++-
 2 files changed, 120 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/extensions/review/src/electron-main/review-electron-main-module.ts b/extensions/review/src/electron-main/review-electron-main-module.ts
